245: ['ALFRED','Three months ago, you told an old man to leave you alone in a cave. I took the hint. Eventually.'],
246: ['BRUCE','And now?'],['ALFRED','Now I have brought tea, a self-defense book, and a rather optimistic list of improvements.'],
247: ['BRUCE','You built all this?'],['ALFRED','We built it, sir. The suit is ready. The car is… mostly ready. I would avoid the red switch.'],
248: ['BRUCE','What about the rest?'],['ALFRED','Batarangs, smoke pellets, and a grapple prototype. Every tool needs a steady hand.'],
249: ['BRUCE','Then I’d better get one.'],['ALFRED','One step at a time, Master Wayne. Begin with the book.']
